        <mxCell id="cap" value="&lt;b&gt;The one thing to notice.&lt;/b&gt; The two halves of the system meet only at the Funding Index. A researcher's search reads what has already been found &amp;#8212; it never sets off a crawl. That keeps results fast, and keeps the load we put on funder websites under our own control rather than under user demand.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Built with&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp; React and TypeScript (web app) &amp;#183; Python and FastAPI (service and crawler) &amp;#183; PostgreSQL on Supabase (index) &amp;#183; Google Gemini (extraction) &amp;#183; Render and GitHub Pages (hosting)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#4B5563;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="70" y="655" width="1140" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
